reims-manager (1.0.1-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Preserve saved display settings when starting a VM.
  * Add refresh-rate and video-acceleration controls to both interfaces.
  * Add an optional QEMU SMB shared-folder integration for macOS guests.
  * Show start and shutdown progress and keep action errors visible.

